### BadWallet API Test Suite
# Port 8080 - badwallet-api

@walletHost = http://localhost:8080

# ==========================================
# PARTIE 1 : badwallet-api (Port 8080)
# ==========================================

### 1.1 Seeder la base de données badwallet-api
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/seed?numWallets=10&eventsPerWallet=100
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.2 Créer un nouveau portefeuille
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+221779998877",
  "email": "testclient@gmail.com",
  "initialBalance": 25000,
  "code": "WLT-TEST001",
  "currency": "XOF"
}

### 1.3 Lister tous les portefeuilles (Paginé)
GET {{walletHost}}/api/wallets?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.4 Consulter un portefeuille par téléphone
GET {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/+221779998877
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.5 Consulter le solde d'un portefeuille
GET {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/+221779998877/balance
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.6 Effectuer un dépôt
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/+221779998877/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### 1.7 Effectuer un retrait (Frais 1% max 5000)
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+221779998877",
  "amount": 10000
}

### 1.8 Effectuer un transfert
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderPhone": "+221779998877",
  "receiverPhone": "+221770000001",
  "amount": 5000
}

### 1.9 Payer un service simple (Woyofal, etc)
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+221779998877",
  "serviceName": "WOYOFAL",
  "amount": 10000,
  "reference": "123456789"
}

### 1.10 Payer des factures multiples (Senelec, etc)
POST {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/pay-factures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+221779998877",
  "serviceName": "SENELEC",
  "factureReferences": ["FACT-001", "FACT-002"]
}

### 1.11 Historique des transactions
GET {{walletHost}}/api/wallets/+221779998877/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.2 Consulter les factures non payées (Proxy HTTP vers payment-service)
GET {{walletHost}}/api/external/factures/SENELEC/+221779998877
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.3 Consulter l'historique des factures (Proxy HTTP vers payment-service)
GET {{walletHost}}/api/external/factures/history/SENELEC/+221779998877
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.4 Consulter l'historique par période (Proxy HTTP vers payment-service)
GET {{walletHost}}/api/external/factures/history/SENELEC/+221779998877/period?startDate=2023-01-01&endDate=2023-12-31
Content-Type: application/json
